      "unit": "U9",
      "title": "九年级 U9 听力·短文 Why We Love Music",
      "type": "passage",
      "kind": "short",
      "speaker": "us_female",
      "transcript": [
        "People all over the world love music.",
        "One reason is that music can express our feelings.",
        "Music can also bring people together at a concert.",
        "Music has no language, so everyone can enjoy it.",
        "A song from long ago can bring back old memories."
      ],
      "translation_cn": "全世界的人都热爱音乐。\n一个原因是音乐能表达我们的情感。\n音乐还能在音乐会上把人们聚到一起。\n音乐没有语言界限,所以人人都能欣赏。\n一首很久以前的歌能唤起旧日的回忆。",
